=== chapter_2 ===
# sprite hide all
# show image bg ch02-uesugi-home-exterior-morning-motorcycle align 0 with fade
# sprite center fuutarou neutral
narrator: Chapter 2: The Hot Springs, a quintessential quintuplets fanfic
Uesugi Home
Fuutarou returns home after a long trip, he gives a quick smile to the closed bakery before opening the door.
# sprite center fuutarou sad
fuutarou: I'm back, mom…
Fuutarou notices the motorcycle that his previous owner had let him borrow on previous occasions.
# sprite center fuutarou neck_scratch
fuutarou: hmm, could that really be the same one? I don't see the manager anywhere. Oh, well. It's best to not stick my nose.
Fuutarou opens the door.
# show image bg ch02-uesugi-entryway-inside-morning align 0 with fade
# sprite center fuutarou neutral
fuutarou: Raiha? Dad? I'm back!
# show image bg ch02-uesugi-main-room-note-table align 0 with fade
# sprite center fuutarou neutral
He notices a paper on the table, which reads...
# sprite hide all
# show image bg ch02-raiha-note-closeup align 0 with fade
narrator: -"Hey, Fuutarou!
It seems Maruo got impatient waiting and his butler's giving us a ride there, we couldn't pass up such an offer, so we're going ahead of you! Don't worry, we were able to call your old manager and he's letting you use the motorcycle for you to use. I mean, it's not THAT bad of a trip, you can make it!
P.S. Don't worry, we left you some money, it should be enough for a drink or two!
Underneath, another message
I'm sorry, brother! Love, Raiha"-
# sprite right fuutarou annoyed
fuutarou: That guy, going off without me. *sigh* I'll have to thank the manager later.
# sprite hide all
# show image bg ch02-uesugi-radio-weather align 0 with fade
As Fuutarou turns on the radio, the forecast mentions possible thunderstorms near the hot springs.
# sprite right fuutarou neutral
fuutarou: Huh, it looks like there might be trouble. I hope everyone gets there fine.
# sprite hide all
# show image bg ch02-warlords-gifts-drawer align 0 with fade
As Fuutarou put his things away, he noticed a book sticking out of his drawer. It was an edition of Historical Warlords, the at the time newest version that came out 3 years ago. After moving it away, it revealed 4 other items.
# sprite right fuutarou worried
fuutarou: I never gave these to them. I'm terrible at cooking, so I thought this would be a better gift for White Day, though I could always try the chocolate to her, I have a better understanding of...
Fuutarou went silent as he slowly put the book back. With a wry smile, he started walking away.
# sprite right fuutarou sad
fuutarou: ..No, it's too late now.
# sprite hide all
# show image bg ch02-onsen-arrival-parking align 0 with fade
Hot springs
A young girl and blonde man get out of a limousine.
# sprite left isanari boisterous_laugh
# sprite right raiha neutral
isanari: Alright! We're back here! Time to drink till I pass out!
# sprite right raiha concerned_scold
raiha: Dad, just because it's a trip doesn't mean you should go overboard.
# show image bg ch02-onsen-ryokan-forest-entrance align 0 with fade
# sprite right maruo onsen_travel_neutral
maruo: I concur with your daughter.
Raiha and Isanari see the very serious Maruo in his suit, coming out of the front door of the inn. Behind him are three of the five quintuplets. Itsuki, Nino, and Ichika
# sprite hide all
# sprite left ichika neutral
# sprite center nino neutral
# sprite right itsuki neutral
narrator: Itsuki Nakano(20):While still studying, she's become the helper of the most successful teacher in her school. She remains ever vigilant about continuing her mother's legacy
narrator: Nino Nakano(20):Now the manager of her own restaurant, she's become a respected leader among her peers. She wishes of having the greatest restaurant in Japan
narrator: Ichika Nakano(20):After her first successful role, she's been receiving more and more offers, becoming a sensation among casual filmgoers and film critics alike.
# sprite hide all
# sprite center raiha cheerful_wave
raiha: Itsuki! Ichika! Nino!
ichika_itsuki_nino: RAIHA!
# sprite hide all
# show image bg onsen-cg-001-raiha-reunion align 0 with fade
The three rush to hug Raiha. At the same time, Isanari goes to Maruo
# show image bg ch02-onsen-ryokan-forest-entrance align 0 with fade
# sprite left isanari cheerful
# sprite right maruo onsen_travel_stern
isanari: Aaaand what do you mean by that? Life is all about the moment, you can't have fun if you're constantly second-guessing yourself.
maruo: Only a fool would see the world in such a light.
# sprite left isanari awkward
isanari: Bleh, I'd rather be a fool than a plank of wood with multiple regrets. By the way, weren't there five of you?
# sprite hide all
# sprite left ichika teasing
# sprite center nino neutral
# sprite right itsuki neutral
ichika: Ah, Miku had problems with her trip, so she won't make it until tomorrow, but Yotsuba should be here soon.
yotsuba: Heeey!
nino: Speak of the devil.
Yotsuba approaches, waving her hand while running towards them
# sprite center yotsuba wave
narrator: Yotsuba Nakano(20):After being accepted into the best athletic university in the country, she's been constantly working out. While she's learned to say no from time to time, she can't help but feel bad for those in need. Now wears a white ribbon.
Maruo turns to her, gripping his sleeves.
# sprite center yotsuba nervous
yotsuba: Ah, sorry, there were some problems with my bus. I wish I had my bike.
The sisters go to her and share a hug.
itsuki: I'm so glad you're doing well. Huh, you changed ribbons?
yotsuba: Huh? Oh, ahaha, funny story. What happened to my other ribbon was-
nino: She lost it.
ichika: Totally lost it.
# sprite right itsuki thoughtful
itsuki: Hmm, are you really doing fine?
yotsuba: At least let me tell the story!
As the sisters reconcile, Yotsuba notices Miku nor Fuutarou are to be seen.
yotsuba: Say, are Miku and Uesugi-san not here yet?
# sprite left raiha neutral
raiha: Ah, well, Dad wanted to come here on limousine, and Mik-
# sprite right nino angry
nino: Uesugi-san!? How are you not on a first-name basis with him!?
Yotsuba looks down, sweating with nervousness.
# sprite center yotsuba nervous
# sprite left ichika warm_smile
ichika: Come now, I'm sure she has a reason. With enough dates, she'll be able to, right Yotsuba?
Yotsuba continues to stare a hole into the ground, unable to say anything.
itsuki: Yotsuba, how many dates have you two gone on together?
yotsuba: W-well, you know how tough it is staying in shape, not to mention Uesugi-san really likes to study, it's like his life is work, haha.
nino: Yotsuba!
yotsuba: Just the one!
# sprite right itsuki indignant
itsuki: Ugh, that jerk. I can't believe he's kept you like this for so long.
yotsuba: No no, it's not his fault, we just haven't seen each other much.
# sprite left raiha surprised_shy
raiha: Hmm? Do you guys not talk to each other?
ichika: Of course she does, we all do. We're friends after all, we always stay in touch.
yotsuba: Yeah, it's just...when I talk to him, it's like his mind is in-
# sprite right maruo onsen_travel_soft_smile
maruo: I'm glad you're safe, Yotsuba-kun. Come, let us meet your Grandpa.
yotsuba: O-Oh, right. C'mon, Raiha, let's go.
# sprite hide all
End of Chapter 2

